<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B31D28;--shiki-dark:#FFFFFF;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark-font-style:inherit;">!</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">ls conf</span></span>
