<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C678DD;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">NOTE</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">: Checkpoint 1</span></span>
